== Section C: Extended Response (40 points, 20 points each)

*17.* A ball is thrown upward from a rooftop. Its height in feet after $t$ seconds is modeled by
$ h(t) = -16 t^2 + 48 t + 4 $.

+ Find the time at which the ball reaches its maximum height, and find that maximum height. Interpret both values in context. (7 points)
+ Find the exact time when the ball hits the ground. Simplify your answer and round to two decimal places. (7 points)
+ Explain why the domain of $h$ in this situation is restricted, and state the restricted domain. (6 points)

#v(4em)

*18.* Let $f(x) = x^3 - 2x^2 - 5x + 6$.

+ Show that $x = 1$ is a zero of $f$, then factor $f(x)$ completely. (6 points)
+ List all real zeros of $f$ and state the $y$-intercept. (4 points)
+ Determine the end behavior of $f$ and sketch a labeled graph showing the zeros and the $y$-intercept. (5 points)
+ Solve $f(x) leq 0$. Write your answer in interval notation. (5 points)

